---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | One Take Wonder Marketing"
  description="Privacy policy for One Take Wonder Marketing. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  canonical="privacy"
>
  <section class="py-20 px-6 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-gray">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-10">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        When you contact us through our website, we collect the information you provide — such as your name, email address, phone number, and business details — solely to respond to your inquiry and provide the marketing services you've requested.
      </p>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We also use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact with our site. This collects anonymized data such as pages visited, time on site, and general location. No personally identifiable information is collected through Analytics.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Your information is used exclusively to communicate with you about our services, provide proposals, deliver marketing services, and send relevant updates. We never sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties for their marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">3. Data Protection</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        We implement reasonable security measures to protect your information. Form submissions are processed through Formspree, which employs industry-standard encryption. Our website is served over HTTPS.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">4. Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
        For questions about this privacy policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@onetakewondermarketing.com" class="text-brand-pink hover:underline">hello@onetakewondermarketing.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
